When @steipete launched @openclaw, he was impressed by its deep use cases for personal use. He then explored how to scale these use cases broadly across an organization.

After experimenting with a single gateway and multiple users, he applied his Kubernetes and infosec skills to deploy OpenClaw to over 500 employees. The deployment has led to a variety of innovative use cases from employees, demonstrating the platform's versatility.

@fagamericano: "Work inside a modern company rarely lives in one place. A single engineering or operations task might start in Slack, require context from GitHub, touch a Google Doc, reference a ClickUp ticket, pull..."
